15. What is 'Contribution'?

Contribution is the sum of money payable to the Corporation by the Principal employer in
respect of an employee and includes any amount payable by or on behalf of the employee
in accordance with the provisions of the Act (Section2(4)).

16. What is the Present Rate of Contribution?

a) Employer’s contribution: A sum equal to 4.75% of the wages payable to an employee,
